  <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout">
   <item>
    <widget class="QTabWidget" name="tabModes">
     <widget class="QWidget" name="tabDuration">
      <attribute name="title">
       <string>按时长</string>
      </attribute>
      <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="tabDurationLayout">
       <item>
        <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="settingsLayout">
         <item>
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblConversion">
           <property name="text">
            <string>默认档 Conversion</string>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>中档（时长介于两个阈值之间）使用的 Conversion。长音效档用「名称_Long」、短音效档用「名称_Short」；工程里找不到时会复制该 Conversion 再改名生成。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QComboBox" name="cbbDefaultConversion">
           <property name="minimumSize">
            <size>
             <width>220</width>
             <height>0</height>
            </size>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>中档（时长介于两个阈值之间）使用的 Conversion。长音效档用「名称_Long」、短音效档用「名称_Short」；工程里找不到时会复制该 Conversion 再改名生成。</string>
           </property>
           <property name="sizePolicy">
            <sizepolicy hsizetype="Expanding" vsizetype="Fixed">
             <horstretch>1</horstretch>
             <verstretch>0</verstretch>
            </sizepolicy>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <spacer name="settingsGroupGap">
           <property name="orientation">
            <enum>Qt::Horizontal</enum>
           </property>
           <property name="sizeType">
            <enum>QSizePolicy::Fixed</enum>
           </property>
           <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
            <size>
             <width>16</width>
             <height>20</height>
            </size>
           </property>
          </spacer>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxUseShort">
           <property name="text">
            <string>短音效</string>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>勾选时区分短音效档：播放时长小于或等于右侧阈值（秒）的样本算短音效，用「名称_Short」的 Conversion；不勾选时这些样本算默认档（中档）。默认勾选，阈值 0.5 秒。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spbShortThreshold">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>短音效判定阈值：播放时长小于或等于该值的样本算短音效档。取消勾选左侧「短音效阈值」时不生效。默认 0.5 秒。</string>
           </property>
           <property name="decimals">
            <number>2</number>
           </property>
           <property name="maximum">
            <double>9999.000000000000000</double>
           </property>
           <property name="singleStep">
            <double>0.100000000000000</double>
           </property>
           <property name="value">
            <double>0.500000000000000</double>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QCheckBox" name="cbxUseLong">
           <property name="text">
            <string>长音效</string>
           </property>
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>勾选时区分长音效档：播放时长大于或等于右侧阈值（秒）的样本算长音效，用「名称_Long」的 Conversion；不勾选时这些样本算默认档（中档）。默认勾选，阈值 5 秒。</string>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="spbLongThreshold">
           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>长音效判定阈值：播放时长大于或等于该值的样本算长音效档。取消勾选左侧「长音效阈值」时不生效。默认 5 秒。</string>
           </property>
           <property name="decimals">
            <number>2</number>
           </property>
           <property name="maximum">
            <double>9999.000000000000000</double>
           </property>
           <property name="singleStep">
            <double>0.500000000000000</double>
           </property>
           <property name="value">
            <double>5.000000000000000</double>
           </property>
          </widget>
         </item>
         <item>
